          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Corrosive Grind",
          "name_format": "bold_italic",
          "description": "A creature being grappled by the lumite must make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw, taking 13 (2d12) slashing damage plus 17 (3d10) acid damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Furthermore, if the target is wearing nonmagical armor and fails this save, the armor is corroded and its bonus to AC is permanently reduced by 1d4. If the bonus is reduced to 0 the armor is destroyed."
        }
